{"attack":"虽然会使自己陷入濒死，但是能够大幅降低对手的攻击和特攻。","description":"令目标的攻击降低2级。\n令目标的特攻降低2级。\n使用者陷入濒死状态，除非此招式没有命中、使用失败或被防住类招式阻挡。\n如果目标处于替身状态，或者对手对该招式免疫（例如恶作剧之心特性的宝可梦对恶系使用该招式），此招式使用失败。但即使该招式无法对对手的能力变化产生效果（例如对手特性为恒净之躯或者对手的攻击与特攻能力变化为-6），招式仍然能够使用成功，使用者陷入濒死状态。\n对具有魔法镜特性的宝可梦使用的话，此招式不会被反弹。这与抛下狠话的情况不同。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Grimer","Level":48},{"Name":"Grimer form:alolan","Level":48},{"Name":"Muk","Level":57},{"Name":"Muk form:alolan","Level":57},{"Name":"Koffing","Level":48},{"Name":"Weezing","Level":56},{"Name":"Weezing form:galarian","Level":56},{"Name":"Moltres form:galarian","Level":65},{"Name":"Hoppip","Level":38},{"Name":"Skiploom","Level":44},{"Name":"Jumpluff","Level":55},{"Name":"Latios","Level":70},{"Name":"Shellos form:east","Level":45},{"Name":"Shellos form:west","Level":45},{"Name":"Gastrodon form:east","Level":53},{"Name":"Gastrodon form:west","Level":53},{"Name":"Stunky","Level":33},{"Name":"Skuntank","Level":33},{"Name":"Spiritomb","Level":30},{"Name":"Uxie","Level":77},{"Name":"Whimsicott","Level":0},{"Name":"Litwick","Level":56},{"Name":"Lampent","Level":64},{"Name":"Chandelure","Level":0},{"Name":"Pyukumuku","Level":60},{"Name":"Sinistea form:phony","Level":54},{"Name":"Sinistea form:antique","Level":54},{"Name":"Polteageist form:phony","Level":54},{"Name":"Polteageist form:antique","Level":54},{"Name":"Bombirdier","Level":0},{"Name":"Tatsugiri form:curly","Level":34},{"Name":"Tatsugiri form:droopy","Level":34},{"Name":"Tatsugiri form:stretchy","Level":34},{"Name":"FlutterMane","Level":21},{"Name":"Gholdengo","Level":70},{"Name":"Ting-Lu","Level":65},{"Name":"Chi-Yu","Level":70},{"Name":"Poltchageist form:counterfeit","Level":54},{"Name":"Poltchageist form:artisan","Level":54},{"Name":"Sinistcha form:unremarkable","Level":54},{"Name":"Sinistcha form:masterpiece","Level":54}],"tutorMoves":[],"eggMoves":["Vulpix","Ninetales","Diglett","Diglett form:alolan","Dugtrio","Dugtrio form:alolan","Misdreavus","Slugma","Magcargo","Delibird","Ralts","Kirlia","Gardevoir","Dus